{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "7f1396a8-2041-4770-bc04-8b1a37c95b00",
    "name": "Smart Health Platform - Complete API Suite",
    "description": "Zero-configuration Postman Collection for the Smart Healthcare microservices ecosystem.\n\nFirst 6 requests in 'auth service' demonstrate native Postman Authorization types:\n1. No Auth\n2. Basic Auth\n3. Bearer Token\n4. JWT Token (RSA-256)\n5. API Key\n6. OAuth 2.0 (Google OAuth)\n\nAll endpoints use direct, literal URLs (no vault, no collection/environment variables).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "auth service",
      "description": "Authentication and authorization service endpoints. First 6 requests specifically demonstrate Postman native Authorization types.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. No Auth (Public Endpoint)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://localhost:8080/api/auth/demo/public",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": [
                "localhost"
              ],
              "port": "8080",
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "demo",
                "public"
              ]
            },
            "description": "1. NO AUTH DEMONSTRATION\n\nPublicly accessible endpoint that requires no credentials, tokens, or headers. Postman Authorization is set to 'No Auth'."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Basic Auth",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "admin@smarthealth.internal",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "admin123",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://localhost:8080/api/auth/demo/basic",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": [
                "localhost"
              ],
              "port": "8080",
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "demo",
                "basic"
              ]
            },
            "description": "2. BASIC AUTH DEMONSTRATION\n\nDemonstrates HTTP Basic Authentication using Postman's native Authorization tab ('Basic Auth'). Postman automatically encodes username:password into Base64 format."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3. Bearer Token",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJodHRwOi8vYXV0aC1zZXJ2aWNlOjgwODEiLCJzdWIiOiJhZG1pbkBzbWFydGhlYWx0aC5pbnRlcm5hbCIsImVtYWlsIjoiYWRtaW5Ac21hcnRoZWFsdGguaW50ZXJuYWwiLCJyb2xlcyI6WyJBRE1JTiJdLCJzY29wZSI6Im9wZW5pZCBwcm9maWxlIGVtYWlsIiwiYXV0aG9yaXRpZXMiOlsicm9sZV9BRE1JTiJdfQ.sample",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://localhost:8080/api/auth/demo/bearer-jwt",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": [
                "localhost"
              ],
              "port": "8080",
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "demo",
                "bearer-jwt"
              ]
            },
            "description": "3. BEARER TOKEN DEMONSTRATION\n\nDemonstrates Bearer Token authentication configured directly in Postman's native Authorization tab ('Bearer Token'). Send a minted RSA-256 JWT (from request #4) in this field."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "4. JWT Token (Mint RSA-256 Bearer Token)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://localhost:8080/api/auth/demo/jwt?role=ADMIN&email=admin@smarthealth.internal",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": [
                "localhost"
              ],
              "port": "8080",
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "demo",
                "jwt"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "role",
                  "value": "ADMIN"
                },
                {
                  "key": "email",
                  "value": "admin@smarthealth.internal"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "4. JWT TOKEN (MINT RSA-256) DEMONSTRATION\n\nMints a live cryptographically signed RSA-256 JWT Bearer token embedded with user roles and claims. Copy the 'token' string from the response and paste it into request #3 Bearer Token or Swagger!"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "5. API Key Auth",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "apikey",
              "apikey": [
                {
                  "key": "key",
                  "value": "X-API-KEY",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "value",
                  "value": "smarthealth-admin-secret-key-2026",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "in",
                  "value": "header",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://localhost:8080/api/auth/demo/api-key",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": [
                "localhost"
              ],
              "port": "8080",
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "demo",
                "api-key"
              ]
            },
            "description": "5. API KEY AUTH DEMONSTRATION\n\nDemonstrates API Key authentication configured in Postman's native Authorization tab ('API Key'). Postman injects the Header 'X-API-KEY: smarthealth-admin-secret-key-2026'."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "6. OAuth 2.0 (Google OAuth)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "oauth2",
              "oauth2": [
                {
                  "key": "grant_type",
                  "value": "authorization_code",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "authUrl",
                  "value": "https://accounts.google.com/o/oauth2/v2/auth",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "accessTokenUrl",
                  "value": "https://oauth2.googleapis.com/token",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "clientId",
                  "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID.apps.googleusercontent.com",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "clientSecret",
                  "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "scope",
                  "value": "openid profile email",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "redirect_uri",
                  "value": "https://oauth.pstmn.io/v1/callback",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "clientAuth",
                  "value": "sendClientCredentialsInBody",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "tokenType",
                  "value": "Bearer",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "addTokenTo",
                  "value": "header",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "https://www.googleapis.com/oauth2/v3/userinfo",
              "protocol": "https",
              "host": [
                "www",
                "googleapis",
                "com"
              ],
              "path": [
                "oauth2",
                "v3",
                "userinfo"
              ]
            },
            "description": "6. OAUTH 2.0 (GOOGLE OAUTH) DEMONSTRATION\n\nDemonstrates OAuth 2.0 Authorization Code flow with Google OAuth in Postman's native Authorization tab ('OAuth 2.0').\nClick 'Get New Access Token' in Postman to launch Google's interactive login prompt with redirect URI 'https://oauth.pstmn.io/v1/callback'."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "7. API Key Auth (POST JSON Body)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
